        <p style={{ font: `11px ${sans}`, color: C.stone, marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>Save contact drops a standard .vcf into the other person's phonebook in one tap (WhatsApp, iPhone, Android). The date stamp marks it as current.</p>
